abstract: >-
  Static research explorer for uses of the Gouden Eeuw (Golden Age) as a
  mnemonic trope in Dutch parliamentary speech between 1945 and 2024.
  It presents 447 coded contributions from the updated research dataset,
  with reviewed speaker identities, paired Dutch and English evidence,
  shared filters, coding combinations, and links to original proceedings.
